      "transcriptHtml": "\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>📜</span>\n<h5>TRANSCRIPT (Lời thoại bài nghe chi tiết)</h5>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div>\n<!-- Task 1 script -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>✦ Audio Script - Task 1 (Hội thoại về sở thích của Trang)</span>\n\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>MC:</strong> Welcome back to our program. Next, we have Trang from Tran Phu school. Hi Trang!</p>\n<p><strong>Trang:</strong> Hi!</p>\n<p><strong>MC:</strong> What is your favourite hobby?</p>\n<p><strong>Trang:</strong> I love <mark>making paper dolls</mark> (Câu 1). I do it whenever I have free time.</p>\n<p><strong>MC:</strong> Oh, when did you start your hobby?</p>\n<p><strong>Trang:</strong> <mark>Three years ago</mark> (Câu 2). My aunt came back from Germany, and she gave me a paper doll. I loved it right away.</p>\n<p><strong>MC:</strong> Do you share this hobby with anyone?</p>\n<p><strong>Trang:</strong> Yes. <mark>My sister</mark> (Câu 3) likes it too. We sometimes have the same ideas and make similar paper dolls.</p>\n<p><strong>MC:</strong> Do you find it difficult?</p>\n<p><strong>Trang:</strong> A little. Because in order to have unique and beautiful paper dolls, I need to be creative and skillful. <mark>(difficult - Câu 4)</mark></p>\n<p><strong>MC:</strong> I agree. How do you make paper dolls?</p>\n<p><strong>Trang:</strong> First, I draw dolls on cardboard and cut them out. Then I draw clothes on <mark>paper</mark> (Câu 5), cut them out and finally put them on the dolls. You know, it is very <mark>interesting</mark> (Câu 6) to design clothes for my paper dolls.</p>\n<p><strong>MC:</strong> You can design clothes?</p>\n<p><strong>Trang:</strong> A little. In order to design more beautiful clothes, I often learn about the clothes that people in different countries wear.</p>\n<p><strong>MC:</strong> Wow, do you think you will continue your hobby in the future?</p>\n<p><strong>Trang:</strong> Sure. My mom said I will become a great designer, but I'm not sure. My dream is to become a teacher.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Task 2 script -->\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>✦ Audio Script - Task 2 (Bí quyết giữ gìn sức khỏe)</span>\n\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Good morning, children! Today I’ll give you some tips on how to keep fit.</p>\n<p>First, <mark>remember to have different kinds of food</mark> (Câu 1: True). Some of you may like hamburgers and want to have it all the time, <mark>but that’s unhealthy</mark> (Câu 2: False). Change your food as often as you can!</p>\n<p>Second, <mark>drink more water and milk</mark> (Câu 3: False vì đề bảo shouldn't). They will bring you more good minerals and help you build strong bones.</p>\n<p><mark>Fruit juice is also good for you</mark> (Câu 4: True) but avoid soft drinks because they have lots of added sugar.</p>\n<p>The next tip is: <mark>Do not use your phones, tablets, computers or watch TV too much!</mark> (Câu 5: True). They are not good for your eyes and they keep you away from physical activities.</p>\n<p>Always keep your body active! <mark>Playing football, badminton, or any kinds of sports will surely bring you good health</mark> (Câu 6: True).</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
